[EXACT COMPUTATION] Per-stratum lift L_k via two independent routes (transfer-energy difference vs autocorrelation shift formula) agreeing on all 110 rows (m=2..18, s≤min(8,m−1), plus (10,9),(11,9)). Positive-L_k strata of the five positive rows:

