## 3. Task-6 repeat mechanism transferred — Verdict: PARTIAL (divisibility transfers, counting does not)

[PROOF] New exact lemma (from R-affine + word↔start bijection): for distinct same-weight words, **v2(B_w−B_{w′}) = v2(h_w−h_{w′})**. Proof: 2^mΔE = 3^kΔh+ΔB; write Δh=2^u·s (s odd, 1≤u≤m−1); then ΔB=2^u(odd), done. [EXACT COMPUTATION] Verified on 25,816 pairs (m=6,8,10), B odd everywhere; colliding-pair census is monotone in r, stabilizing at the exact-equality floor (m=10,k=5: 15876→170). Pair-census vs histogram C: 28/28 agree; bridge_a L_k headlines re-verified stratum-by-stratum.

[DIAGNOSTIC] The transfer **fails at the counting step**: Task 6 needs an infinite sequence with polynomial growth to contradict exponential gap demands. Here starts are confined to [1,2^m) — finite universe — and the modulus 2^(m+r) outgrows it, so the constraint migrates into B-differences, whose odd-cancellation distribution no reachability invariant constrains. The only derivable bound collapses to |L_k| ≤ q·cap_s ([PROOF], 1440/1440 exact cases — finite check of a proved bound): true but useless — tightness max 2/3 at (4,2,2), and 1/252 where it matters ((10,9) k=6). **GAP (stated, not papered over): control of Δ=N_d−N_{d+q} beyond the triangle bound.** The generic (3,2) witness proves no bound of this shape works without deeper word-level structure.

